  "description": "FELMUH crystallizes in the cubic crystal system with space group I -4 3 d. Reported CIF formula moiety: C118 H86 La6 O36 S9. From the CIF bond table, La1 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La2 (La) has 8 O neighbors; La1F (La) has 9 O neighbors; La2F (La) has 8 O neighbors; La1I (La) has 9 O neighbors; La2I (La) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.849-5.265 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 88.04-145.97°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [La6(μ6-CO3)(L)6(LH)3(H2O)5(OH)]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 5 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
